-- words --
On a Goal the owner's select event holds, the owner's place is refused: the Goal has two candidates C1 and C2, and the owner selects C1; the owner places a new example on line-1; the place exits 1 with the Selected refusal, and the Goal still shows selected.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp place GOAL --examples goals/draft-more 2>&1; echo "place exit $?"; HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status GOAL | head -1
-- floor: contains --
has a select; it takes no place, run or second select
-- floor: contains --
place exit 1
-- floor: contains --
GOAL  selected
